<p id="S2.T1.6" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="S2.T1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">Note:<span id="S2.T1.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> #Tests/T = Test case number per task; #LOC/T = Line number of code per task;
#Tokens/T = Code token number per task; #LD = Task number with library dependencies;
LD% = Percentage of tasks with dependencies.</span></span></p></div></div>
