<p id="S5.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Cells with <span id="S5.I2.i1.p1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#E1FFFF;">light cyan</span> background denote the highest LDA rate in each direction among all strategies.</span></p>
